 "notes": "One-way shore dive: in at the Golden Blocks entry, out along the drop-off past the golden coral towers and back in over the house reef in front of Happy Life Village, exiting by the hotel jetty. OSM and the Happy Life dive centre put the house reef south-west of the Golden Blocks entry, so the path is drawn that way (assumption). Positions are approximate. The exit point is the jetty from OpenStreetMap.",
